{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_susuro_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_susuro_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"专业医师","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_susuro_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"652602229c621b8c0ec68927e51b0a1110eb0d2418646fdbdf1082007e4542c6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在莱塔尼亚办事处要求紧急支援的申请下，苏苏洛带领罗德岛医疗团队前往现场支援。怪物袭击、感染者，伤患......灾难已经发生。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"几点了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"四点，你都问了几遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我急啊！你不急吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点。急有啥用啊，他们从本舰赶过来的，能平安到达都谢天谢地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，三天怎么从本舰赶过来？有点厉害啊，本舰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你没去过罗德岛本舰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"没去过，这一趟车费可不便宜，再说还有一堆事情要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"本舰有一种大型浮空交通工具，移动速度特别快，没见过吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"浮空的？车？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那肯定不是车......具体的我也叫不上来名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦，是高塔的术师老爷们用的那种高级货，天上飘的那种？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是那个！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀你别猜了，我见得不多，也讲不太清，回头看到就懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么闲，再检查一下车，回去的时间可就很紧了，别出岔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"行行行......你是老大，你说了算。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，这次本舰来的是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你都没去过本舰，说了名字你也不认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这边递交的是紧急申请，无论来的是谁，肯定是医疗部门的精锐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"这次事情可不小啊，这来的得是啥样的精锐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这你就别操心了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，他们来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"这载具......有点厉害啊，本舰还有这种东西，长见识了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，准备接人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎来到莱塔尼亚，我是本地办事处的负责人菲勒加斯，叫我菲勒就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我是本舰医疗干员苏苏洛，这几位是我的助手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员B","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你愣着干什么，打个招呼啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哦！哦！对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"办事处干员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我是办事处的......司机......不对，我是本地办事处的干员，代号活塞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"情况很复杂，我们时间紧急，各位先上车吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这次突发事件的详细情况，我们打印了全套资料，就先在车上看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，麻烦您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还携带了一些设备，也麻烦您搬到车上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两个小时后"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看第二份文件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你检查一下这份报告，确定一下有没有需要额外准备的器材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（喂！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，说话鬼鬼祟祟的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"你小点声！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说派来的都是精锐么，怎么领队的是这么个小姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子说话注意点，小心我扣你奖金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"什么时候养成的以貌取人的烂毛病？员工手册白看了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不懂就管住嘴，这位是真的本舰医疗部门精锐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好......我的错，我的错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲勒先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文件我看完了，我有几个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据描述，这次险情中大部分需要医疗救助的人都不是矿石病感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样的，虽然莱塔尼亚官方通报的说法是天灾导致城市破坏与伤亡，但是实际情况比这要复杂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是天灾信使的工作失误么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"目前来看......并不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这次针对天灾的撤离行动本来是没有任何问题的，至少从流程上没有遇到任何问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一的问题是......谁都没想到天灾飓风的路径下有至少十片针蚤的大型巢穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那个村子虽然提前开始了移动，但是上百只逃离天灾的针蚤直接冲到了迁徙的队伍里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"针蚤？就是那种一米多长的食肉虫子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"上百只？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前有伤亡数字吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"莱塔尼亚官方信源还没有给出明确的数字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"已经两天了，还没有得出结论......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说明伤亡人数暂时无法统计。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"领地卫兵把很多伤者送到了附近的城镇，我们还没来得及一一查看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"办事处储备的医疗物资还充足吗？处理针蚤毒素的解毒剂储量呢？手术设备保养状况如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当地其他医疗救护队的调动情况呢？我需要这些文件上没有收录的信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗物资方面，暂且还算充沛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"本地的掌权者第一时间就开始了救援工作，罗德岛办事处在接到委托之后也得到了充足的应急救难物资补给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗设备状况都不错，但它们不会自己动起来，我们的人手严重不足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"镇子里的医生算得上训练有素，但缺乏紧急情况下的应对经验，很多人一辈子没见过这种大灾大难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"办事处驻扎的城镇人口不多，因此，全镇加起来也只有三个小诊所，能做手术的医生就更少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"很多伤患没能撑到手术台上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"办事处现在容纳了很多难民，情况非常不乐观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，在这样混乱的情况下，我们无法第一时间对人群进行区分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"送来的病人里是有感染者的......而感染者逝世之后的情况......你明白我的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一段路程，你们先休息一下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我们到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这边已经有不少人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"伤患应该都转移到办事处附近了，办事处的其他工作人员应该正在处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"活塞你在这里等着，一会儿会有其他站点的补给车过来，你在这里接应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里干等着？合适吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你第一次参加这种任务，现场情况比你想的要残酷得多，老老实实在这里接收和分派医疗物资吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"开玩笑，那几个小姑娘都能去，我一个大老爷们怕什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......臭小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"行，没问题，回头可别说我没提醒你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目全非的伤患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"水......给我水......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸！爸爸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血肉模糊的伤患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"过来一个人！这个感染者快不行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普通伤患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者！别，别过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么在这儿？快回到收治区去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卫兵！卫兵！人呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的妈啊......这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这比我想的还要惨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我前天来的时候，那边的大院子还是本地商会的货运站，现在已经被征用作为普通病患的收治区了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"医生人手太过有限，只有伤势最重的人能优先在医疗室得到抢救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些躺在地上的人......是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这些应该都是感染者，这座镇子比较小，没有感染者收容区，他们不能把感染者和普通人安置在一个地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不能把他们就这么丢在广场上，菲勒干员，办事处的仓库能腾出多少空间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在就安排把东西全搬出来，问题不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还需要一个单独的空间容纳伤重的感染者，最好是能单独隔开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那就只能把员工宿舍空出来了，这需要一点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交给您了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一组去库房，检查感染者的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二组，三组和我来，把设备都搬到手术室里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对伤患的分类和对应的安置就麻烦您了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我也来帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，你来搭把手，帮我把这几个人抬到屋里去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"使用源石技艺加速伤口愈合之前，一定要确定毒素已经清理干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果伤口不严重，就尽可能不要动用源石技艺，医生的体力是现在最宝贵的资源，合理调配才能保住更多性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先处理这一床！这里有个危急病人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"（倒抽一口凉气）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他为了保护家里人，被针蚤咬掉了胳膊，送过来的时候已经失去意识了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是感染者，不过病情还稳定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他的手呢？残肢还留着么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（摇了摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"创面已经细菌感染了，左手也有肉眼可见的大面积溃烂，可能还得截掉一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这样岂不是两只手都要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去帮二组吧，这边交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦您了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要愣着，准备感染者应急处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"患者的体表结晶在咽喉处，检查一下血液。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意他腕部的鳞片，准备萨弗拉专用的手术刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屋子里的灯还是太暗了，活塞先生，确认一下发电机的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三个小时后\n办事处医疗室内，重症伤患的手术依然没有停止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伤员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"医生......我是不是没救了......医生，你告诉我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腔内出血较多，给血液吸引器换个瓶子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伤员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"求求你......求求你医生，把这个戒指......带给我妻子，求求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会活下来的，坚持住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纱布用完了，再拿一点过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伤员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别......别骗我，我知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要说话！你会活下来的，我保证！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮忙按住这里，我来缝合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"双氧水也用完了，谁去仓库拿一箱过来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活塞先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好！我，我马上去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血止住了，剩下的交给你，我去看一下其他床。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里！队长！刚送过来一个，快不行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奄奄一息的伤患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胸腹联合伤，腹部开放性外伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进去，优先处理，先切开他的食道与气管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......天哪......天哪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要停下来！还有其他病人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"检查一下有没有脏器破损！看看有没有腹膜后的出血点！快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......我有点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......我......我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，辛苦了。你先去外面休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......谢谢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......太可怕了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"呕............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......本舰的人，平时都要面对这种局面么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃......又来......呕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......还好，还好，我只是不太习惯这种......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"给，毛巾，擦把脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃呕......有点丢人。没想到我是现场里第一个坚持不住的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，你表现得还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"这样算是还不错？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你自告奋勇跑去帮忙，坚持了半天，你也不是专业的医疗干员，我本来预计你半个小时就扛不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"那个小姑娘......不，那位医疗干员，还真是厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我之前怎么给你说的。他们是本舰的精锐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这位叫苏苏洛的医疗干员，是几年前帕勒莫事件的亲历者，不要小看她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"帕勒莫事件？啊......就是当年那个轰动叙拉古的事件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"是源石矿厂爆炸那次？我记得有很多平民急性感染，同时医疗准备不足导致急性感染者大量死亡......好像有半个城区濒临崩溃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"那才是真正的人间地狱。想象一下，大量感染者急性发作，遍地都是已经开始崩解的感染者遗骸，漫天都是活性粉尘的恐怖景象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"帕勒莫事件的很多亲历者都留下了严重的精神创伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"对这位医疗干员来说，今天的场面根本不算什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我还是进去帮忙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你消停会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"一会儿你又吐在里面，反而给她们添麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......也是喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"这么想帮忙，就去安置区看看有没有沟通工作，顺带也检查一下其他办事处的补给车有没有来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我这就去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，臭小子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......要命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，医生，怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这次实在是多亏了你们，大部分伤患的情况现在都稳定了，接下来就看领主那边怎么做后续安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以前还觉得你们根本就不是医疗公司，实在是......真的是......不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感谢你们，我感谢你们，我......我一时找不到更好的词，要不是你们的救援，伤亡人数和伴生灾害简直不可想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我只是个打杂......额......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗干员呢？他们休息了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本地医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也不太清楚他们去哪了，我还以为你们罗德岛的人会更清楚呢，我看你们的宿舍都拿来安置伤患了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......知道了，你先早些休息吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，本部来的医......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，你小点声！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么事，出去说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"他们......算了，让他们歇着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"安置区怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么问题，领主的人都到了，他们已经转移了第一批轻症伤患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"顺利就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么想说的就直接说，别吞吞吐吐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么......只是觉得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"想辞职了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"没，只是对罗德岛的这份工作加深了一点认识......大概吧，一点点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"有干劲是好事啊，既然你还有干劲，那现在就去清点一下医疗物资的消耗情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"做两份记录，一份给办事处留档，一份明早递交给本地政府。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我这就去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"四天后"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"东西都收拾好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，没问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"来了来了来了，差一点没赶上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"你干什么去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这不是苏苏洛小姐让我帮忙买东西吗，我都买来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......这些是给凯尔希医生的书，这个是给嘉维尔医生的工艺品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么，零食？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个是给博士的......小礼物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？就是......那个博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，替我向凯尔希医生和博士问好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"最后祝你们一路顺风，安全抵达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苏苏洛","speakerId":"avg_298_sussu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您，我们下次再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"他们走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，回去干活吧，还有一大堆报告要写。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活塞","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是也该找个工作机会去罗德岛本舰看看呢......感觉都是些很奇妙的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲勒加斯","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊，但是，先把自己手上的活儿干完再琢磨吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["办事处干员B","菲勒加斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]}]}
